# Semgrep path-level suppressions
#
# Add paths here to exclude entire files or directories from Semgrep scans.
# For single-line suppressions within a file, add a trailing comment instead:
#
#   some_code()  # nosemgrep: rule-id
#
# Format (one glob per line):
#   path/to/file.cs
#   path/to/directory/
#
# Example:
#   tests/Fixtures/InsecureSampleForTesting.cs  # intentionally insecure test fixture
